                                       "modo de dissolução"@pt ,
                                       "解散態様"@ja ,
                                       "解散方式"@zh ;
                            martialis:conceptScheme <https://w3id.org/martialis/vocab/dissolution-manner> .


###  https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology#dissolvedEvent
martialis:dissolvedEvent rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
