                      rdfs:comment "Copyright or licence status of the media file itself, as one value on a single axis: a Creative Commons licence where one was granted, otherwise a rightsstatements.org statement. Absence means the status has not been evaluated. Distinct from imageAttribution, which credits the item to a source and makes no legal claim, and from informationType and evidenceType, which are epistemic."@en ;
                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology> ;
                      rdfs:label "Bildrechte"@de ,
