                                          "source classification"@en ,
                                          "来源分类"@zh ,
                                          "資料分類"@ja ;
                               martialis:conceptScheme <https://w3id.org/martialis/vocab/source-classification> .


###  https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology#sourceGenre
martialis:sourceGenre rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                      rdfs:domain martialis:Source ;
                      rdfs:range skos:Concept ;
                      rdfs:comment "What the content is (biography, obituary, interview, promotional, ...), independent of sourceType's bibliographic form - a `webpage` can be any of these."@en ;
                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology> ;
                      rdfs:label "Quellengattung"@de ,
                                 "genre de la source"@fr ,
                                 "género da fonte"@pt ,
                                 "género de la fuente"@es ,
                                 "source genre"@en ,
                                 "tegund efnis"@is ,
                                 "来源体裁"@zh ,
                                 "資料ジャンル"@ja ;
                      martialis:conceptScheme <https://w3id.org/martialis/vocab/source-genre> .


###  https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology#specializationOf
martialis:specializationOf rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                           rdfs:domain martialis:Source ;
                           rdfs:range martialis:Source ;
                           rdfs:comment "The resource this Source is one dated state of: a capture of a web page whose content changes, or a revised issue of a roster. The state inherits every field of that resource it does not state itself; evidence cites the state, never the resource."@en ;
                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology> ;
                           rdfs:label "Spezialisierung von"@de ,
                                      "especialización de"@es ,
                                      "especialização de"@pt ,
                                      "specialization of"@en ,
                                      "spécialisation de"@fr ,
                                      "sérhæfing á"@is ,
                                      "特定時点の版"@ja ,
                                      "特定版本所属"@zh ;
                           rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7089> ;
                           skos:closeMatch prov:specializationOf ;
                           skos:scopeNote "Not containment (martialis:partOf) and not an edition (martialis:editionOf). In Memento terms (RFC 7089) the resource is the URI-R and each state records its URI-M as schema:archivedAt, with martialis:archiveDate as the Memento-Datetime."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology#styleForm
martialis:styleForm rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                    rdfs:domain martialis:Style ;
                    rdfs:range skos:Concept ;
                    rdfs:comment "How a style is composed or practised, independent of origin period: hybrid and/or sport. Multi-valued. 'sport' means principally rule-governed competition."@en ;
                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology> ;
                    rdfs:label "Stilform"@de ,
                               "form stíls"@is ,
                               "forma del estilo"@es ,
                               "forma do estilo"@pt ,
                               "forme du style"@fr ,
                               "style form"@en ,
                               "流派形态"@zh ,
                               "流派形態"@ja ;
                    martialis:conceptScheme <https://w3id.org/martialis/vocab/style-form> .


###  https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology#styleRelationType
martialis:styleRelationType rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                            rdfs:domain martialis:StyleRelationAssertion ;
                            rdfs:range skos:Concept ;
                            rdfs:comment "Relation kind: derived_from, split_from, influenced_by, sibling_style_of, variant_of. variant_of is materialized as martialis:variantOf/hasVariant."@en ;
                            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology> ;
                            rdfs:label "Art der Stilbeziehung"@de ,
                                       "style relation type"@en ,
                                       "tegund stílatengsla"@is ,
                                       "tipo de relación entre estilos"@es ,
                                       "tipo de relação entre estilos"@pt ,
                                       "type de relation entre styles"@fr ,
                                       "流派关系类型"@zh ,
                                       "流派関係種別"@ja ;
                            martialis:conceptScheme <https://w3id.org/martialis/vocab/style-relation> .


###  https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology#styleType
martialis:styleType rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                    rdfs:domain martialis:Style ;
                    rdfs:range skos:Concept ;
                    rdfs:comment "Origin period, deliberately culture-neutral: traditional, modern, other. Culture-specific period terms belong in tags."@en ;
                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology> ;
