###  https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology#lineageTradition
martialis:lineageTradition rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                           rdfs:domain martialis:Source ;
                           rdfs:range xsd:boolean ;
                           rdfs:comment "True when the Source is a lineage or organisation recounting its own past (a school or federation history, a founding story, a genealogy chart, a densho), so it shares one origin with every other account from inside that lineage and cannot corroborate them. Not set on everything a body publishes: its record of its own act (a grade register, a same-day announcement, a current member list) is not tradition. Extends the Mills independence test; orthogonal to martialis:sourceClassification: an original densho is still lineage-internal."@en ;
                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology> ;
                           rdfs:label "hefð ættleggsins"@is ,
                                      "lineage tradition"@en ,
                                      "tradición del linaje"@es ,
                                      "tradition de la lignée"@fr ,
                                      "tradição da linhagem"@pt ,
                                      "Überlieferung der Linie"@de ,
                                      "流派伝承"@ja ,
                                      "流派传承"@zh .


