                rdfs:comment "A training establishment, where training happens: a dojo, club, academy or school programme. It always occupies at least one site, but its identity is the establishment's continuity, not its address, so a move is a new dated site, not a new record. Distinct from any Organization that governs it; its teaching staff are hasInstructorRole and its offices hasOfficerRole."@en ;
