               rdfs:comment "A site a Place or Organization occupied: its locality (required), an optional street address and map point, an optional Place it sat within, and the period when the sources date it. The only home for where a Place or Organization is; the current locality is the site or sites with no end year. No period means the period is unsourced, not that the site covers the record's whole life."@en ;
               rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology> ;
